  "loiGiai": "Ta có:\\\\\r\n\t\t$\\vec{u} = (2; 3; -1) \\Rightarrow 2\\vec{u} = (4; 6; -2)$.\\\\\r\n\t\t$\\vec{v} = (1; 3; 2) \\Rightarrow -3\\vec{v} = (-3; -9; -6)$.\\\\\r\n\t\t$\\Rightarrow \\vec{w} = 2\\vec{u} - 3\\vec{v} = (1; -3; -8)$.\\\\\r\n\t\t$\\Rightarrow \\left|\\vec{w}\\right| = \\sqrt{(1)^2 + (-3)^2 + (-8)^2} = \\sqrt{74}$."
